an AMD Athlon machine, because building it native takes very long :)

Is there anything I can do to help? I have a serial console setup, but
didn't use a debugger over it yet. I don't need the tga device, so as
last resort I could just comment it out. The machine is basically a box
for testing, so I don't mind trying things out with it :)

Thank you!

Regards,=20
Andreas Kohn

